cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "STMMDN: Spatial-Temporal Multivariate Mixture Density Networks"
abstract: >-
  Network architecture of the GNN-ALSTM-TTM model and its three ablations: an
  (attention-)LSTM temporal encoder and a rolling-covariance dynamic graph
  neural network feeding a two-component multivariate Student's t mixture
  density output layer. Market data, trained models, the training pipeline and
  the portfolio strategies of the paper are not included.
